    129→Sets `options.method` to the method name and makes a request.
    745→### ky.extend(defaultOptions)
    …
    747→Create a new `ky` instance with some defaults overridden with your own.
    749→In contrast to `ky.create()`, `ky.extend()` inherits defaults from its parent.
    751→You can pass headers as a `Headers` instance or a plain object.
